    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1146">

                <pb facs="1060" n="802" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg802"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Portugal</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Birch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-09-02T11:00:00+00:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 2, 1915, 11 a. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 1 p. m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>26. Your telegram unnumbered, August 30, 5 p. m. Portuguese Government has not
                    embargoed arms and ammunition. Would be negligible factor.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Birch</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
